description = "A Flash Player written from scratch in Zig: SWF 4-8, ActionScript 1/2 (AVM1), including Flash Lite. The gamepad is bound to each movie's OWN keys, surveyed from its bytecode at load — so the D-pad sends the arrow keys to a game that reads arrows and the phone keypad to one that reads 2/4/6/8. Every binding can be overridden in Core Options, along with playback speed. Sound plays (PCM, ADPCM, MP3 and FLV audio), and save states and rewind work. AVM2/AS3 files are rejected by design."
